+// ── DEMO MODE (2026-07-13) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
+// Screen-recording-safe data isolation. Activated via `CAREER_OPS_DEMO=1` env
+// var (set by `npm run dashboard:demo`) or a `--demo` CLI flag. When active:
+//   1) dataPath() below is the single chokepoint that redirects every named
